Put your figures here.

Refer to them from a chapter with a path relative to the chapter file:

    #image("../report-images/name.png", width: 80%)

Relative rather than "/report-images/name.png", because a leading slash means
"the project root", and the root is whatever your editor or your typst command
says it is. Open a parent folder as your workspace and every absolute path
breaks. A relative path does not care.
